	(text "SOURCE: TI TPS2663 SLVSE94G Fig 8-7 and SLVUBI8A Fig 11; manufacturer MOSFET diagrams.\nFUNCTION: fuse/TVS, reverse-input and reverse-current block, UV/OV cutoff, input inrush/current limit.\nMODIFICATION: UV ~8.46 V / OV ~27.63 V; PG ~7.94 V; 4.02k ILIM; 100nF dVdT; MODE open=latch.\nRATIONALE: admit normal9-24 V; no two-times pulse mode; downstream EN held low during input ramp.\nQ101 body diode: VIN_FUSED -> VIN_EFUSE_IN. Q102 source is VIN_FUSED, not ground.\nOPEN: fuse order code/I2t, source/surge profile, Q101 footprint and fault SOA qualification.\nLOCAL SHDN/FLT test access only; do not connect to host. No PCB or surge compliance claim."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
